WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.148
Copying is done.

00:00:01.439 --> 00:00:02.820
But one base doesn't match.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.932
Special repair proteins scan the new DNA.

00:00:06.327 --> 00:00:08.300
Like a spell-checker reading a finished essay.

00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:09.426
Found it.

00:00:10.053 --> 00:00:10.808
A mismatch.

00:00:11.655 --> 00:00:13.153
Enzymes cut around the mistake.

00:00:13.223 --> 00:00:14.256
They remove that piece.

00:00:15.104 --> 00:00:16.868
Then they fill in the correct bases.

00:00:17.495 --> 00:00:19.841
Mismatch repair fixes wrong bases after copying

00:00:19.887 --> 00:00:20.456
is finished.

00:00:21.083 --> 00:00:23.475
Next up: damage from UV light.

00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:24.763
Swipe.
